 "_doc": "The store's categories. A skill goes into the first category in 'order' whose words occur (at a word start) in its name, package name, description or tags; 'overrides' place a package by hand; 'klondike' maps klondike-mercantile's own category when no word matched. Labels are in locale/<lang>/category.<name>.dialog. 'names' give a package without a proper name in its manifest a readable one (others are made from the package name). 'descriptions' give a package whose manifest has none (or just its name) an English description.",
